hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"135","Al-Hasan bin Qaza bin Ubaid Al-Hashimi narrated to us, Sufyan bin Habib narrated to us, on the authority of Ibn Jurayj, on the authority of Uthman bin Abi Suleiman, on the authority of Ubaid bin Umair, on the authority of Aisha, who said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “The siwak purifies the mouth, pleasing to the Lord.”"
